              "value": "Trigger: The dragon is the target of a ranged attack\n\nRequirements: The dragon is aware of the attack and has a free wing\n\nThe cloud dragon flexes a wing and creates a billowing cloud of mist. The dragon is treated as if they were hidden for the purposes of resolving the triggering attack, so normally the attacker must succeed at a DC 11 flat check to target them. The dragon also gains a +4 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack."
